        {
          "title": "iPhone 16 的可拆卸电池",
          "content": "<p>拆过手机的同学都知道，手机电池是用胶水固定的，非常难拆。</p>\n<p>新推出的 iPhone 16 系列，采用一种新的电池拆卸机制，使得拆电池变得很容易。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202409/bg2024092411.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>拆开手机后，电池板下面有两个电极，用充电宝或电池（9V 或 12V）给它们通电。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202409/bg2024092412.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>大概一分钟后，电流就会使得胶水融化，从而顺利取下电池。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202409/bg2024092413.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>清除底板上残留的胶水，也变得容易，然后可以重新涂上胶水，把新电池换上去。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202409/bg2024092414.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>这种新的电池拆卸机制，以后应该会得到推广，提升智能手机的可维修性。</p>",
          "links": [
            {
              "text": "iPhone 16 的可拆卸电池",
              "url": "https://www.ifixit.com/News/100352/we-hot-wired-the-iphone-16"
            }
          ],
          "images": [
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202409/bg2024092411.webp",
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202409/bg2024092412.webp",
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202409/bg2024092413.webp",
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202409/bg2024092414.webp"
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "iPhone 时钟",
          "content": "<p>苹果的很多产品设计，都受到德国博朗（Braun）电器的启发。博朗曾经推出过一款时钟，苹果至今还未借鉴。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202409/bg2024092406.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>一位国外程序员突发奇想，能不能把 iPhone 改造成这样的时钟。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202409/bg2024092407.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>他用 3D 打印制作了一个支架。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202409/bg2024092408.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>然后，把 iPhone 放在里面，就成了一款漂亮的时钟。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202409/bg2024092409.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>",
          "links": [
            {
              "text": "iPhone 时钟",
              "url": "https://arslan.io/2024/09/23/dieter-rams-inspired-iphone-dock/"
            }
          ],
          "images": [
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202409/bg2024092406.webp",
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202409/bg2024092407.webp",
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202409/bg2024092408.webp",
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202409/bg2024092409.webp"
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "5G 玻璃天线",
          "content": "<p>传统的 5G 基站是下图这样，白色的外壳部分是天线。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202409/bg2024092001.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>这样的基站很引人注目，在市区也不容易找场地。</p>\n<p>为了解决这个问题，一家日本公司最近宣布，开发了玻璃天线。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202409/bg2024092002.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>这种天线把导电材料与透明树脂混合，然后夹在两片玻璃之间，看上去就是普通的窗玻璃（注意顶部的导线）。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202409/bg2024092203.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>信号通过玻璃，传给基站。这种方法将建筑物的外墙玻璃，变成 5G 天线，从而大大方便了 5G 基站的部署。</p>",
          "links": [
            {
              "text": "5G 玻璃天线",
              "url": "https://spectrum.ieee.org/5g-antenna-transparent-window"
            }
          ],
          "images": [
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202409/bg2024092001.webp",
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202409/bg2024092002.webp",
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202409/bg2024092203.webp"
          ]
        },
        {
